  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target community is individuals who identify with or support nationalist, white supremacist, and xenophobic ideologies. This includes those who believe in the myth of land theft by immigrants, who view the American flag as a symbol of racial entitlement, and who perceive immigrants as threats to national identity and resources. The meme is designed to resonate with audiences who embrace militaristic imagery as justification for exclusionary policies and who are influenced by racist tropes that frame immigrants as undeserving or dangerous. The visual and textual elements are tailored to appeal to those who identify with white supremacist rhetoric and who see themselves as the rightful stewards of the land, thereby inciting hostility toward immigrant communities.",
